# Noto Sans CJK JP (SIL OFL 1.1) is fetched on demand — keeping the binary
# out of git keeps the repo small. Download instructions live in this
# directory's README. The xtask reads the file from here at run time, so
# `cargo run -p xtask-generate-test-pdfs` fails with the download command
# until it is present. Compiling the workspace does not need it.
NotoSansCJKjp-Regular.otf
